SUMMARY:Spring Bazaar at Bacchus Landing
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season at Bacchus Landing's Spring Bazaar\, happening Saturday\, May 2\, and Sunday\, May 3\, in the heart of Healdsburg wine country. Stroll the piazza and browse a thoughtfully curated collection of local artisans\, makers\, and small businesses featuring handcrafted goods\, seasonal finds\, art\, home decor\, jewelry\, gifts\, and more.Make a day (or a weekend) of it—sip and taste with Bacchus Landing's acclaimed wineries\, enjoy the fresh spring air\, and discover unique treasures while supporting the local community. Whether you're shopping for Mother's Day\, treating yourself\, or just soaking up the atmosphere\, the Spring Bazaar is the perfect way to welcome the season.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/spring-bazaar-at-bacchus-landing-2/
LOCATION:14210 Bacchus Landing Way, Healdsburg, CA, 95448
CATEGORIES:Fairs & Festivals
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/04/08070452/spring-bazaar-bacchus.jpg
END:VEVENT
