SUMMARY:Oak Knoll Spring Celebration at Bartholomew Estate
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season at the Oak Knoll Spring Celebration at Bartholomew Estate Winery. Enjoy a festive day on the Knoll featuring a curated wine flight\, live music by Jacob Philip Benning\, and delicious bites available for purchase from a local food truck. Relax and take in the stunning views of the estate while welcoming spring in a lively and scenic setting.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/oak-knoll-spring-celebration-at-bartholomew-estate/
