SUMMARY:Garagiste Wine Festival at Veterans Memorial Hall
DESCRIPTION:The 8th Annual Garagiste Festival: Northern Exposure returns to Sonoma\, giving guests rare access to Northern California’s top small-production winemakers. Featuring over 30 micro-production wineries each producing under 1\,500 cases annually\, this event offers a unique opportunity to taste innovative varietals and blends poured directly by the passionate winemakers themselves. Many participating wineries do not have regular tasting hours\, making this a truly exclusive experience.    Garagiste celebrates small-batch\, hands-on winemaking\, where every sip reflects the creativity\, dedication\, and terroir of its makers. Attendees can uncover flavors\, stories\, and techniques that defy convention\, creating a personal journey through the region’s boutique wine scene.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/garagiste-wine-festival-at-veterans-memorial-hall/
LOCATION:126 1st St W , Sonoma, CA, 95476, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Drink,Fairs & Festivals,Sonoma County,Wine,Wine Tasting
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/03/19133343/Screenshot-2026-03-19-153138.png
END:VEVENT
