SUMMARY:Experiment Farm Open House and Plant Sale at Luther Burbank Experiment Farm
DESCRIPTION:Spring into the season at the Luther Burbank Experiment Farm Open House and Plant Sale. Wander the historic grounds where Burbank ran his legendary breeding experiments\, tour his original cottage\, and browse rare plants\, fruit trees\, and pollinator favorites for sale. Sunday\, May 3\, 2026\, 10:00am to 3:00pm in Sebastopol. Free admission; plant sale proceeds support the farm's preservation.      Event Tickets  Visit Website  
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/experiment-farm-open-house-and-plant-sale-at-luther-burbank-experiment-farm/
LOCATION:7777 Bodega Hwy, Sebastopol, 95472
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Family Friendly,Outdoors,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/04/15050707/Luther-Burbank-Experiment-Farm.png
